{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017223246796-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017225419\"/><p>事主送院後不治。</p><p>今午(17日)5時43分，屯門小欖康輝路一院舍職員報案，指一名姓姚(70歲)男院友，進食糊仔時懷疑骾喉暈倒。救援人員接報到場，姚翁昏迷被送往屯門醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:59:12.530832+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:32:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T14:57:36.718085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:57:36.718085+00:00","content_hash":"fb888db79e4090f4bbda4fdec183d77b6f7fe9d8b338af813bd39a72533e0784","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}